{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bloomcraft is a Garden Creation Simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's goal is to create a garden that pleases the Flower Queen.<br>The more the Flower Queen likes the garden, the more money she pays for it every second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Money can be used to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new flower types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crossbreed planted flowers to create completely new and unique flower varieties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve garden parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cover garden maintenance costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of real-life flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millions of unpredictable flower varieties from crossbreeding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 different garden layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Flower Queens, each with a unique taste in gardens</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625230?t=1743521881","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625230?t=1743521881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625230/60b0b79b2ec0abdd107da90e80fc495ace53f1a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743521881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625230/60b0b79b2ec0abdd107da90e80fc495ace53f1a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743521881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bloomcraft is a Garden Creation Simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's goal is to create a garden that pleases the Flower Queen.<br>The more the Flower Queen likes the garden, the more money she pays for it every second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Money can be used to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new flower types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crossbreed planted flowers to create completely new and unique flower varieties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve garden parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cover garden maintenance costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of real-life flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millions of unpredictable flower varieties from crossbreeding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 different garden layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Flower Queens, each with a unique taste in gardens</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sad Hare Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625230/1b9f204c30257c03ffcf2ecbbdd27233ec9ce6a2/header.jpg?t=1743521881","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Bloomcraft","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 / AMD R7-260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recom